.TH pvc-migrate-script 1  "pvc-migrate-script " 
.SH NAME
pvc\-migrate\-script \- Convert a legacy S.* script into a preset
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpvc\-migrate\-script\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISCRIPT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Migrates a legacy `S.*` shell script\*(Aqs own variable block into a preset TOML for `pvc run`, printed to stdout.
.PP
Only `S.plainpv`\-shaped scripts (`pvroutine=plainpv`) are mapped today \- see `pvc\-cli::migrate`\*(Aqs doc comment. Any variable with no `pvc pv` equivalent is listed in a trailing comment rather than silently dropped.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISCRIPT\fR>
Path to the legacy `S.*` script to migrate
